  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life saving support on SRH and GBV response to adolescents and women affected by flooding in the northern regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide reproductive health and protection - gender based violence assistance to people affected by floods in Peru northern regions. This UNFPA project provides services on SRH and GBV response to adolescent girls and women. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 225,000 people, including 200,000 women, and  25,000 children, including 11,338 people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
